    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The NAKI Files is a first-person multiplayer-coop survival horror.</strong> In it, you must spread hidden knowledge to humanity, which is dominated by the Anunnaki*, the maestros of the world government matrix. It's 2027, and the 2030 agenda came sooner than we expected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*The name &quot;Anunnaki&quot; has been translated in various ways. One of them means &quot;one who came from heaven to earth,&quot; they are descendants of Anu, from the Highlands. They are beings with elongated skulls, who in Sumerian texts claim to have created the humanity they themselves manipulate.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352850/extras/27e62bd88cf4c1a12dc8478bf2958b38.poster.avif?t=1753239218\" width=768 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352850/extras/27e62bd88cf4c1a12dc8478bf2958b38.webm?t=1753239218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352850/extras/27e62bd88cf4c1a12dc8478bf2958b38.mp4?t=1753239218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story with some rogue-lite elements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is divided into phases. Each phase consists of 9 rounds, each more difficult than the last, but the procedure is the same: Awaken enough people to progress, while the Anunnaki try to stop you personally. If everyone dies, it's game over, and you'll have to restart the phase from round 1.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For each person you awaken, you receive some Credit. Use these credits to unlock Amulets that change the way you play and help you progress even further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352850/extras/3260ceda804f7d76cdff40fb8fede259.poster.avif?t=1753239218\" width=682 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352850/extras/3260ceda804f7d76cdff40fb8fede259.webm?t=1753239218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352850/extras/3260ceda804f7d76cdff40fb8fede259.mp4?t=1753239218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hundreds of possibilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the scenario in creative ways. Position cameras, land mines, and shoot shotguns at the Anunnaki. Out of ammo? Use kitchen plates, improvise something.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find secrets scattered throughout the map. Correlate information to understand more than what is simply written in the books, thus progressing further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dress however you want by going to the Wardrobe during a match. All outfits are available and can be combined to your liking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352850/extras/0be362295cfd844e106def77ab0c572d.poster.avif?t=1753239218\" width=616 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352850/extras/0be362295cfd844e106def77ab0c572d.webm?t=1753239218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352850/extras/0be362295cfd844e106def77ab0c572d.mp4?t=1753239218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Author's note</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Dense in knowledge, symbologies, positive references, and a pinch of creative freedom, The NAKI Files is ultimately a love letter to all those who feel different in this world. They feel something is wrong but don't know where to look.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014 TheLastMage</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The NAKI Files is a first-person multiplayer-coop survival horror.</strong> In it, you must spread hidden knowledge to humanity, which is dominated by the Anunnaki*, the maestros of the world government matrix. It's 2027, and the 2030 agenda came sooner than we expected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*The name &quot;Anunnaki&quot; has been translated in various ways. One of them means &quot;one who came from heaven to earth,&quot; they are descendants of Anu, from the Highlands. They are beings with elongated skulls, who in Sumerian texts claim to have created the humanity they themselves manipulate.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352850/extras/27e62bd88cf4c1a12dc8478bf2958b38.poster.avif?t=1753239218\" width=768 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352850/extras/27e62bd88cf4c1a12dc8478bf2958b38.webm?t=1753239218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352850/extras/27e62bd88cf4c1a12dc8478bf2958b38.mp4?t=1753239218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story with some rogue-lite elements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is divided into phases. Each phase consists of 9 rounds, each more difficult than the last, but the procedure is the same: Awaken enough people to progress, while the Anunnaki try to stop you personally. If everyone dies, it's game over, and you'll have to restart the phase from round 1.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For each person you awaken, you receive some Credit. Use these credits to unlock Amulets that change the way you play and help you progress even further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352850/extras/3260ceda804f7d76cdff40fb8fede259.poster.avif?t=1753239218\" width=682 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352850/extras/3260ceda804f7d76cdff40fb8fede259.webm?t=1753239218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352850/extras/3260ceda804f7d76cdff40fb8fede259.mp4?t=1753239218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hundreds of possibilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the scenario in creative ways. Position cameras, land mines, and shoot shotguns at the Anunnaki. Out of ammo? Use kitchen plates, improvise something.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find secrets scattered throughout the map. Correlate information to understand more than what is simply written in the books, thus progressing further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dress however you want by going to the Wardrobe during a match. All outfits are available and can be combined to your liking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352850/extras/0be362295cfd844e106def77ab0c572d.poster.avif?t=1753239218\" width=616 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352850/extras/0be362295cfd844e106def77ab0c572d.webm?t=1753239218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352850/extras/0be362295cfd844e106def77ab0c572d.mp4?t=1753239218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Author's note</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Dense in knowledge, symbologies, positive references, and a pinch of creative freedom, The NAKI Files is ultimately a love letter to all those who feel different in this world. They feel something is wrong but don't know where to look.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014 TheLastMage</p>",
    "short_description": "Unveil the conspiracies by publishing everything online in this MULTIPLAYER-COOP survival horror. Type everything manually on the computer, defend your home Home Alone-style, and unload bullets on the Anunnaki trying to stop you.",
